+ SaturationValuePainter is Painter

+ hue F64

────────────────────
+ This
    - hue

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

=? if rect.width <= 0 || rect.height <= 0
. across = linear-gradient(rect.left-center, rect.right-center, white, RGBA(1, 1, 1, 0))
. down = linear-gradient(rect.top-center, rect.bottom-center, transparent, black)
do use canvas.saved-state
    canvas.stroke-color = null
    canvas.fill-color = HSVA(hue, 1, 1) as RGBA
    canvas.rect(rect)
    canvas.fill-gradient(rect, across)
    canvas.fill-gradient(rect, down)

