╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

=? if rect.width <= 0 || rect.height <= 0
fill-checkerboard(canvas, rect, color-picker-checker-cell, checker-light, checker-dark)
. inset = min(rect.height, rect.width) / 2
. start = Point(rect.x + inset, rect.y + rect.height / 2)
. end = Point(rect.right - inset, rect.y + rect.height / 2)
. clear = color.with-alpha(0)
canvas.fill-gradient(rect, linear-gradient(start, end, clear, color))

