╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

=? if rect.width <= 0 || rect.height <= 0
if color.alpha < 1
    fill-checkerboard(canvas, rect, color-picker-checker-cell, checker-light, checker-dark)
do use canvas.saved-state
    canvas.stroke-color = null
    canvas.fill-color = color
    canvas.rect(rect)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ color-input-value
    - text String
    - alpha F64

match? source
    ~ input \rgb-function !.
        if input.has-alpha then input.color else input.color.with-alpha(alpha)
    ~ color RGBA !.
        if source.length == 4 || source.length == 7 then color.with-alpha(alpha) else color

.. trimmed = text.trim()
.. source = if trimmed.starts-with("#") || trimmed.starts-with("rgb") then trimmed else "#$trimmed"
